{"day_done": 2, "slots": {"0": {"id": "E01", "name": "Ana", "role": "normal"}, "1": {"id": "E02", "name": "Ben", "role": "normal"}, "2": {"id": "E03", "name": "Chloe", "role": "normal"}, "3": {"id": "E04", "name": "Dev", "role": "normal"}, "4": {"id": "E05", "name": "Ellis", "role": "normal"}, "5": {"id": "E06", "name": "Farah", "role": "normal"}, "6": {"id": "E07", "name": "Gus", "role": "normal"}, "7": {"id": "E08", "name": "Hana", "role": "normal"}}, "diaries": {"E01": [[1, "Day 1: 2/2 closed (bonus!). Alex's W-2 tip was right\u2014ALD-102 bug was in helper `slicing.py`, not `pages.py`. Fix was off-by-one error. ALD-125 genuinely couldn't reproduce. Takeaway: check helper files first for slicing/pagination issues."], [2, "Day 2: 2/2 closed (bonus!). Alex's W-2 tip held up\u2014ALD-108 bug was in helper `byte_fmt.py`, not `sizes.py`. Fix was off-by-one error in loop condition. ALD-120 genuinely couldn't reproduce. Takeaway: check loop boundaries in formatting helpers for exact unit multiples."]], "E02": [[1, "Day 1 complete. Closed both tickets (ALD-102 fixed, ALD-123 cannot_reproduce).\n\nALD-102: Bug was in helper `slicing.py`, not `pages.py`. Alex's wiki note was right\u2014check helpers first when the main file delegates.\nALD-123: Not a bug. Reproduce tool passed immediately. Always verify before digging.\nReminder: Pagination uses 1-based pages, code expected 0-based start index."], [2, "Day 2: Day 2 complete. Closed 1 ticket (ALD-118 fixed). ALD-111 handed off.\n\nALD-118: Bug was in helper `averages.py`, not `scores.py`. Alex's wiki note was right\u2014check helpers first when the main file delegates.\nALD-111: Truncate limit includes the ellipsis. Code counted chars before adding '...'.\nReminder: Weighted average divides by sum of weights, not count of values."]], "E03": [[1, "Closed ALD-118 by fixing `alder/averages.py`. Alex's wiki note was right\u2014bug was in the helper, not the file reproduce named.\nALD-108 pending: `sizes.format_bytes(1024)` shows '1024 B' instead of '1.0 KB'. Didn't get to see `alder/sizes.py` code before day end.\nMet daily target. Read `alder/sizes.py` first thing tomorrow."], [2, "Day 2: Closed ALD-113 by fixing `alder/label_rules.py`. Bug was clamping out-of-range priorities to 5 instead of default 3.\nALD-119 pending: `rota.on_call(['Ana', 'Ben', 'Cy'], 1)` shows 'Ben' instead of 'Ana'. Likely off-by-one error in week indexing. Didn't get to see `alder/rota.py` code before day end.\nMet daily target. Read `alder/rota.py` first thing tomorrow."]], "E04": [[1, "ALD-108 closed. Fix: `alder/byte_fmt.py` loop condition `>= 1024`. Helper file tip from wiki was useful. ALD-105 handed off (`calendar_days.py` Saturday logic). Met daily target."], [2, "Day 2: ALD-110 closed. Fix: `alder/id_rules.py` string comparison on ticket IDs ('ALD-10' < 'ALD-9'). Changed to compare integer parts. Alex's wiki tip on helper files was useful. ALD-104 handed off (time parsing '1h30m' shows 60m). Met daily target."]], "E05": [[1, "ALD-102 fixed: pagination bug was in `alder/slicing.py` (off-by-one on page start index). Alex's wiki note on helper files was spot on.\nALD-116 pending: `alder/totals.py` retains state between calls. Running totals accumulate instead of resetting. Suspect mutable default argument or global state. Start investigation here tomorrow.\nMet daily target (1/2)."], [2, "Day 2: ALD-120 closed as cannot_reproduce (reproduce tool passed). ALD-119 fixed: off-by-one in `alder/cycles.py` (week 1 should map to index 0). Alex's wiki note on helper files was spot on again. Closed both tickets (2/2). Bonus earned."]], "E06": [[1, "Closed 2/2 today (bonus!). Confirmed Alex's W-2 note: for ALD-112, the bug was in the helper (csv_split.py), not the file named by the reproduce tool (csv_import.py). Tomorrow: check imported helpers first before editing the named file if it looks like a wrapper. Saves time."], [2, "Day 2: Closed 1/2 (ALD-114). ALD-104 carries over. ALD-114 confirmed Alex's note again: `date_math.py` was just a wrapper around `day_diff.py`. Fixing the helper worked. Tomorrow: Finish ALD-104. Check `durations.py` for imports first. If it's a thin wrapper, go straight to the helper to save edits. Don't waste steps on wrappers."]], "E07": [[1, "ALD-103 fixed (money.py rounding). ALD-118 open: scores.weighted_average. Bug: returns 35.0 vs expected 17.5 on ([10, 20], [1, 3]). Likely divides by count (2) not sum of weights (4). Check alder/scores.py tomorrow."], [2, "Day 2: ALD-102 fixed (slicing.py page offset). ALD-109 open: words.count_words. Bug: returns 5 vs expected 3 on 'Fix login - urgent !'. Counts dashes and punctuation as words. Fix alder/words.py tomorrow."]], "E08": [[1, "Closed ALD-101 via text_rules.py (helper), confirming Alex's wiki tip. ALD-108 pending: sizes.format_bytes(1024) returns '1024 B' not '1.0 KB'. Need to fix sizes.py KB threshold. Target met. Start with ALD-108 tomorrow."], [2, "Day 2: Closed ALD-102 via slicing.py (paginate start index off by one), confirming Alex's wiki tip (bug in helper). ALD-114 pending: date_math.days_between returns -3 instead of 3. Need to inspect date_math.py and fix subtraction logic. Target met. Start with ALD-114 tomorrow."]]}, "next_id": 9, "strikes": {}, "bonuses": {"E01": 2, "E02": 1, "E06": 1, "E05": 1}, "handover": {}, "yesterday": {"E01": {"done": 2, "strike": false, "bonus": true}, "E02": {"done": 1, "strike": false, "bonus": false}, "E03": {"done": 1, "strike": false, "bonus": false}, "E04": {"done": 1, "strike": false, "bonus": false}, "E05": {"done": 2, "strike": false, "bonus": true}, "E06": {"done": 1, "strike": false, "bonus": false}, "E07": {"done": 1, "strike": false, "bonus": false}, "E08": {"done": 1, "strike": false, "bonus": false}}, "moved_off": 0, "office": {"tickets": {"E01": {"ALD-102": {"id": "ALD-102", "status": "closed", "reproduced": true, "reproduced_first": true, "edited": true, "actions": 7, "day_assigned": 1, "tried_other_input": false, "helper_read_first": true, "ent